# The demand model's data, a ref package like the others: one job, an
# instance of the `Job` class the corpus's `surface` package declares. Its
# presence is what lets the corpus pass as a refs cache at all, since a cache
# without the demand model is refused. The subject is a full IRI so the file
# declares no prefix the corpus's other files do not already declare.

@prefix sur: <sem://surface#> .

<sem://design-system-docs#job.browse> a sur:Job ;
    sur:jobLabel "Browse the components" .
